segments.text:
In adding afterwards euery one: he deſcends
from the generall in which hee comprehended all,
to the particular: to teach euery one apart, whether it be not ſo indeede: for a ſentence generally propounded, moues vs not ſo much, as when euery man conſiders that it belongs to him in ſpeciall. Let euery one then awaken vp his owne conſcience, and let him preſent himſelfe before the iudgement ſeate of God, confeſſing his miſery.
